      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This annotation discusses the process of writing guidelines on procedure-related pain management by a diverse group of paediatricians and a consumer. It examines possible reasons for the huge gap between evidence and clinical practice and recommends that all health professionals look at their own experiences of pain growing up."},
